        "description": "<p>For those who are using llms on macbook, Want to understand how macbook is different than dedicated GPU in running those models? and how to know how much a macbook is capable of running a model?</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48694802\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48694802</a></p>\n<p>Points: 10</p>\n<p># Comments: 14</p>",
